    "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to reach and activate all goal cells in each level. A goal is completed by stepping onto its cell only when the carried piece exactly matches the goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation. Completing all goals advances to the next level; finishing all levels wins.",
    "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (e.g., MOVE_NORTH/SOUTH/EAST/WEST). Movement can be blocked by walls, leaving you in place. Moving costs stamina; if stamina reaches zero you lose a life, and losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece\u2019s attributes: shape modifiers cycle the piece\u2019s shape, color modifiers cycle its color, and rotation modifiers rotate it 90\u00b0 clockwise. The game reports which attributes mismatch for each goal and where relevant modifier tiles are located so you can route to them, then return to the goal and step on it while matched."
